Continuous Delivery vs Continuous Deployment – Made Simple!

Think of it like online shopping 🛒:

Continuous Delivery → Your package is ready at the warehouse ✅, but it won’t ship until you click confirm.

Continuous Deployment → The moment the package is ready 📦🚚 … it ships to your doorstep automatically.

That’s the difference:
👉 Delivery = manual approval before going live.
👉 Deployment = fully automated, no waiting.
